<title>GERMANY: Buba says Bonn to offer 10 bln Dmk in 6-mth bills.</title>
<headline>Buba says Bonn to offer 10 bln Dmk in 6-mth bills.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Tuesday that the German government would offer around 10 billion marks of six-month Bubills in a tender on Tuesday, July 15.</p>
<p>Banks may bid for the paper up until 0900 GMT on Wednesday, July 16 and the pay date will be Friday, July 18, the Bundesbank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The Bubills are the WKN 111 423 series.</p>
<p>-- Kate Kelland, Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
